 104:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * @p Handler as the handler for the interrupt identified by @p bIRQAddr.
 105:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * @p Handle is also registered and passed as first argument to the @p Handler function when it
 106:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * is executed.
 107:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   */
