 119:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c **** /** @brief Executes the function registered for the interrupt identified by
 120:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * @p bIRQAddr and returns its return value.
 121:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * @p flag is passed as second argument to the handler function, the first being the pointer
 122:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * that was registered with it.
 123:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/ui_irq_handler.c ****   * @p rx_data is passed as third argument to the handler function.
